+                "the main subjects, visible on-screen text/data, and important audio."
+            ),
+            "document": (
+                "Read this PDF or text document. Extract its important text, tables, "
+                "structure, and visual information; summarize the content relevant "
+                "to the user's request."
+            ),
+        }
